      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s91",
          "text": "If you're looking up upholstery cleaning prices in Toronto, you probably want a straightforward answer before you book. At SoftNest Fabric Care, we provide written quotes for your furniture rather than a fixed online price list. Tell us what you'd like cleaned and we'll confirm the work and total, including tax.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-97",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [
        {
          "_type": "link",
          "_key": "l94",
          "href": "/quote/"
        }
      ],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s93",
          "text": "You can call, text or use our ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s95",
          "text": "quote form",
          "marks": [
            "l94"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s96",
          "text": ". Photos can help us understand the layout or a particular stain, but they're optional. Asking for a quote doesn't book an appointment.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-99",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s98",
          "text": "What affects a sofa or sectional cleaning quote?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-101",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s100",
          "text": "The size, material, condition and items you want cleaned all matter. A compact three-seat sofa and a large sectional with a chaise may have similar seat counts but very different amounts of upholstery.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-103",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s102",
          "text": "Describe the whole piece, including corner sections, recliners, a chaise or an ottoman. If you're not sure how to count it, just describe the layout. We can clarify it with you instead of asking you to work out a price yourself.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-105",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s104",
          "text": "Mention separate chairs, decorative pillows or other furniture you'd like included. For carpets, give approximate room or rug dimensions and list stairs and landings separately. Parking is confirmed with you as part of planning the visit.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-107",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s106",
          "text": "What's included in our upholstery cleaning price?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-109",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s108",
          "text": "For the furniture and areas agreed in your quote, our service includes:",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-111",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s110",
          "text": "Stain treatment where needed, suited to the fabric and the type of mark.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-113",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s112",
          "text": "Deep cleaning with professional extraction equipment.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ],
      "listItem": "bullet",
      "level": 1
    },
