      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s122",
          "text": "We check the material and condition before choosing the method. Included stain treatment means we work on suitable marks; it doesn't mean every stain or colour change can disappear. Read ",
          "marks": []
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s124",
          "text": "what's included in sofa cleaning",
          "marks": [
            "l123"
          ]
        },
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s125",
          "text": " for details about surfaces and access.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-128",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s127",
          "text": "What if the job needs something different?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-130",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s129",
          "text": "Tell us about pet accidents, previous cleaning attempts and any unusual concerns when you request the quote. If an item needs a different approach, we'll discuss it before agreeing the work. Additional furniture or a change in the requested treatment should be clarified with you first.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-132",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s131",
          "text": "The written quote should make it easy to see which pieces and areas are covered. If something isn't clear, ask. You shouldn't have to wait until the equipment is set up to understand what you're buying.",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-134",
      "style": "h2",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s133",
          "text": "When do I pay?",
          "marks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "_type": "block",
      "_key": "editorial-136",
      "style": "normal",
      "markDefs": [],
      "children": [
        {
          "_type": "span",
          "_key": "s135",
          "text": "Payment is collected after the service is complete. We confirm the total price, including tax, before booking. If you want to know which payment method to use, check with us when arranging the appointment.",
